==Battleground==
*2 [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Squire Rel]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[R.Ost]]s spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**3 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**3 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**3 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Bring 3-4 meatshields, standard R.Ost counters like [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] variants, [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]], [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Awakened Ururun]], [[Red Riding Mina (Special Cat)|Awakened Mina]] or [[Jagando Jr. (Special Cat)|Lord of Ruin Jagando Jr.]], and an [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red]] like [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] or [[Bath Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Luxury Bath Cat]] to kill St. Pigges. Additionally, you could bring Attack UP [[Cat Combo]]s to make your attackers more effective at their jobs.

Since this stage has an enemy limit of 4, it's entirely possible to avoid the fight with the R.Osts by knocking the Piggies behind the base with units such as [[Pirate Cat (Rare Cat)|Dread Pirate Catley]] and [[Bean Cats (Special Cat)|Val Val Cat]], while using another unit like [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]] to wear the base down quicker. Do NOT use [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] if you have unlocked his explosion talent, as his explosions will eventually kill the Piggies, which may cause the R.Osts to spawn.

==='''Recommended Units'''===
*[[:Category:Long Distance Cats|Long Distance attackers]] - Long Distance allows units such as [[Red Riding Mina (Special Cat)|Awakened Mina]] to hit R.Ost behind the St. Pigges. No matter what Long Distance unit you use, try to stack a few before hitting the enemy base.
*[[Jagando Jr. (Special Cat)|Lord of Ruin Jagando Jr.]] - Good crowd-control and damage against the R.Osts, which helps ease a lot of their pressure.
*[[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] - Deals huge damage towards [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red Enemies]], making it the ideal choice for killing the buffed St. Pigges. It is outranged by R.Ost, though, so it won't be a totally free win.

